        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: On the Radio, November Rain\n- People: Regina Spektor, Axl Rose\n- Bands: Guns N' Roses\n- Albums: Begin to Hope, Use Your Illusion I\n\nFacts:\n- Guns N' Roses released the song \"November Rain\" as a single in 1992 from their third studio album, \"Use Your Illusion I\" (1991).\n- Axl Rose, the lead singer of Guns N' Roses, wrote the song \"November Rain.\"\n- \"On the Radio\" is the first single from Regina Spektor's fourth album, \"Begin to Hope.\"\n- The chorus of Regina Spektor's song \"On the Radio\" contains references to the song \"November Rain\" by Guns N' Roses.",
